  "job_B16.10.8_20251003_114351": {
    "text": "Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisum gewrite be \u00feam halgum reliquium, \u00fee \u00e6\u00feelstan se wur\u00f0fulla kyning geaf into\nWytodlice se ilca kyning \u00e6\u00f0elsta, \u00fea\u00fea he \u00e6fter his f\u00e6der Edwarde cynerice onfeng & \u00feurh Godes gife\nAnd he ongan smeagan & \u00feeahtian, hw\u00e6t him s\u00e6lost w\u00e6re to gefor\u00f0ienne of his cynelicum madmum\nSe \u00e6lmihtiga God, \u00fea\u00fee eallum \u00feam\u00fee wel \u00feenca\u00fe simle is fultum & fir\u00feriend, gesende \u00feam godan\nHe sende \u00fea ofer s\u00e6 getriwe men & gesceadwise.\nAnd hig ferdon swa wide landes swa hig faran mihton & mid \u00feam madmum begeaton \u00fea deorwur\u00f0estan\nAnd hig \u00feone \u00feam fores\u00e6dan cyninge brohton & se cyning mid micelre blysse Gode \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feancode.\nHe bebead \u00fea, \u00fe\u00e6t man her on Exancestre, \u00fe\u00e6r\u00fe\u00e6r him \u00e6r God \u00feone nyttwir\u00f0an ge\u00feanc onbesende,\nAnd he geaf \u00feiderinn six & twentig cottlifa & \u00feone \u00feryddan d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s fores\u00e6dan haligdomes \u00feyderinn\nNu wille we eow segcan butan \u00e6lcere leasunge, hw\u00e6t se haligdom is, \u00fee her on \u00feisum halgan mynstre\nErost Of \u00feam sylfan deorwyr\u00f0an treowe \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode, \u00fee Crist on \u00ferowode & us ealle \u00fe\u00e6ron of\nOf Drihtenes byrgene.\nOf \u00feam gyrlan, \u00fee ure Drihten silf on him h\u00e6fde, \u00fea\u00fea he her on worulde betwix mannum w\u00e6s.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re bynne, \u00fee ure Drihten on l\u00e6g, \u00fea\u00f0a he w\u00e6s of sancta Marian acenned.\nOf Iordane, \u00fee ure Drihten w\u00e6s on gefullod.\nOf \u00feam spere, \u00fee ures Drihtenes halige syd w\u00e6s mid geopenod on \u00fe\u00e6re rode.\nOf \u00feam beode, \u00fee se H\u00e6lend onuppan hine gereordode mid his twelf apostolum.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re dune Synay, \u00fe\u00e6r\u00f0\u00e6r God anuppan atiwde \u00feam halgan Moyse & him \u00f0\u00e6r \u00fea ealdan \u00e6\nOf \u00feam \u00feorn\u00feifele, \u00fee wundorlice barn & \u00feeah ungewemmed w\u00e6s fram \u00e6lcere b\u00e6rninge, \u00fea\u00f0a God silf\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re dune, \u00fee ure Drihten onuppan f\u00e6ste.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re candele, \u00f0e Godes engel ontende mid heofenlicum leohte \u00e6t ures Drihtenes sepulchre on\nOf \u00feam altare, \u00fee ure Drihten silf gehalgode.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re stowwe, \u00fee ure Drihten w\u00e6s on geeacnod.\nOf Oliuetes dune, uppan \u00fe\u00e6re se H\u00e6lend hine geb\u00e6d gebigedum cneowwum to his heofenlican F\u00e6der,\nOf \u00feam girlan \u00fe\u00e6re heofenlican hl\u00e6fdian sancta Marian.\nOf \u00feam heafodcla\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan Godes modor & of hire fexe.\nOf sumere halignisse, \u00fee se heahengel Michahel on eor\u00fean geswutelode.\nOf sanctus Iohannes lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s fulluhteres & of his gew\u00e6dum.\nOf sanctus Petrus apostoles berde.\nOf sanctus Petres fexe.\nOf sanctus Petrus girlan.\nOf sanctus Paules apostoles swurbane & of his cla\u00f0on.\nOf sanctus Andreas stafe \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles.\nOf sanctus Iohannes cla\u00f0on \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles & godspelleres, \u00fee ure Drihten to \u00f0on swi\u00f0e lufode, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAnd \u00fea\u00f0a he on \u00fe\u00e6re rode for us \u00f0rowode, \u00fea bet\u00e6hte he \u00feam ilcan Iohanne, his dyrlinge, sancta\nEac her is of \u00feam heofenlican mete, \u00fee w\u00e6s funden on Iohannes byrgene \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles.\nOf sanctus Bartholomeus heafde \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles.\nOf sanctus Iacobes reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles.\nOf sanctus Stefanes heafde \u00fe\u00e6s forman Cristes martyres & of his halgan blode & of \u00feam stane, \u00f0e he\nOf sancto Oflamno \u00feam martyre, \u00fee w\u00e6s Petrus m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles.\nOf sanctus Laurentius reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elan martyres & of \u00feam gl\u00e6don \u00fee he w\u00e6s mid for Cristes\nOf sancto Uincentio \u00feam dyacone & martyre.\nOf sanctus Georgies banum \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran Cristes cempan & martyres.\nOf sancte Sebastiane \u00feam martyre manege ban.\nOf reliquion \u00fe\u00e6ra twegra bro\u00f0ra & martyra Tyburtius & Ualerianes.\nOf sancto Urbane \u00feam papan & martyre.\nOf sancto Apollonare \u00feam biscope & martyre.\nOf sancte Candides banum \u00fe\u00e6s martyres.\nOf sanctus Mauricies reliquion \u00f0\u00e6s martyres.\nOf sancto Quintino \u00feam martyre.\nOf \u00feam martyrum Luciane & Maximiane.\nOf sancto Quirino martyre.\nOf sancto Cornelio \u00feam papan & martyre.\nOf sancto Marcelle.\nOf sancto Petre \u00feam martyre.\nOf sancto Iuliane \u00feam martyre.\nOf reliquion sanctus Cyriaces \u00fe\u00e6s wur\u00f0fullan dyacones & martyres.\nOf reliquion Crisantes \u00fe\u00e6s martyres & Darian \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6denes.\nOf sancto Geruasie \u00feam martyre.\nOf sancto Christofore \u00feam martyre.\nOf sancte Conones lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s martyres.\nOf sancto Uite \u00feam martyre.\nOf \u00feam deorwir\u00f0um martyrum Crispine & Crispiniane.\nOf sanctus Nicasies reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s martyres.\nOf sancte Iuuenales reliquion & of his earme.\nOf sancto Tiburtio \u00feam martyre.\nOf sancte Uiuianes blode \u00fe\u00e6s martyres.\nOf \u00feam martyre Eresie.\nOf sanctus Benignes banon \u00fe\u00e6s martyres.\nOf sancto Pancratio \u00feam \u00e6\u00f0elan martyre.\nOf sancto Desiderio \u00feam martyre.\nOf sancto Iusto \u00feam martyre.\nAnd of sancte Ladio.\nOf sancto Felice \u00feam papan.\nOf sanctus Cesaries banum \u00fe\u00e6s martyres & of his cla\u00f0on.\nOf sancte Eustachie \u00feam martyre.\nOf sanctus Eadwardes reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges, \u00fee w\u00e6s unsce\u00f0\u00f0ig acweald.\nAc hine si\u00f0\u00f0an Crist wur\u00f0ode mid m\u00e6nigfealdum tacnum.\nEac her beo\u00f0 manegra martyra reliquias, \u00fee on Hierusalem for Cristes naman w\u00e6ron gemartyrode.\nOf sancto Uitale \u00feam unoferswi\u00f0odan martyre, se w\u00e6s swa cucu for Cristes naman on eor\u00f0an\nAc he lifa\u00f0 nu mid blisse on \u00feam heofenlican rodere, & eallum, \u00feam\u00fee her on eor\u00f0an mid geleafan to\nHer is eac sanctus Mauricies to\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan martyres, \u00fee under Maximiane \u00feam casere for Cristes\nAnd six\u00f0usend & six & sixtig martyra for\u00f0 mid him \u00ferowedon, \u00fe\u00e6ge ealle \u00feurh his tyhtinge to \u00feam\n\u00deis sind eac \u00fea reliquias \u00fe\u00e6ra haligra confessorum, \u00fe\u00e6t is Cristes andettera, \u00fe\u00e6ge forsegon \u00feas\nErost of sanctus Martines reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s wuldorfullan biscopes, se\u00fee her on life betwix manegum\nOf sancto Siluestre \u00feam wur\u00f0fullan papan.\nOf sancto Gregorie.\nOf sancto Hieronime \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelan lareowe, se\u00fee betwix o\u00f0rum m\u00e6nigfealdum bocum, \u00fee he gedihte,\nOf reliquion sanctus Augustines \u00fe\u00e6s wisan & \u00fe\u00e6s snoteran biscopes, se gedihte an \u00feusend boca Criste\nOf sancte Germane \u00feam apostolican were, \u00fee on \u00feisum lande & eac on o\u00f0rum landum gehw\u00e6r\nOf sanctus Basilius to\u00f0e & of his biscopstafe.\nOf sanctus Euurties lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes, \u00feam atiwde dextera Dei, \u00fe\u00e6t is Godes swi\u00f0re, \u00fea\u00f0e he\nOf sanctus Audoenes reliquion.\nOf sancte Medardes banum \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sancto Crispino.\nOf sancte Maurilie \u00feam biscope.\nOf sancto Galle \u00feam biscope.\nOf sancto Lupo \u00f0am biscope.\nOf sancte Benedicte \u00feam halgan abbude.\nOf sancte Remigies reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s deorwir\u00f0an biscopes, \u00fee eall Francrice to Cristes geleafan gebigde,\nOf sancte Anianes lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s halgan biscopes.\nOf sancte Maximines lichaman confessoris.\nOf sanctus Wulframnes reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sancto Crispo.\nOf sanctus Nicolaus reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s arf\u00e6stan & \u00fe\u00e6s benty\u00f0an biscopes, \u00fee \u00feurh Godes mihte manege\nOf sancte Petroces banum & of his fexe & of his cla\u00f0on.\nOf sancte Winwaloe \u00feam abbode.\nOf sancte Winarde \u00feam biscope.\nOf sancte Wernoco.\nOf sancte Wigenoce.\nOf sancte Tutes h\u00e6ron \u00f0\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sanctus Odones reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran biscopes.\nSancte Iuuenales earm \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sancte Dyonetes earme \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sancte Ipotemies earme, Cristes andetteres.\nOf sancte Concanes heafde & of his earme.\nOf sancte Designates reliquion.\nSanctes Auites ribb \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sanctus Melanies banon \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sancte Wi\u00f0enoces lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nOf sancte Valerianes reliquion.\nOf sancte Tuduale.\nOf sancte Simeones sepulchro.\nOf \u00feam stane, \u00fee sanctus Siluinus b\u00e6r \u00f0riwa to Rome.\nOf sancte Saluines cla\u00f0on.\nOf sancte Maioce & sancte Ermelane.\nOf sancte Liudgere \u00feam biscope.\nOf sancte Sigebrane.\nOf sancte Marcelle \u00feam deorwir\u00f0an Cristes halgan & of sancte Viuiane.\nOf sancte Wulmare \u00feam halgan abbode.\nOf sanctus Petrus reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s halgan dyacones, \u00fee w\u00e6s sanctus Gregories leorningcnyht \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elan\nEac her beo\u00f0 reliqui\u00eb of manegum halgum f\u00e6mnum & of \u00feam halgum Cristes m\u00e6denum, \u00fe\u00e6ge \u00feurh\nErost of sancta Maria Magdalene fingerli\u00f0e, seo\u00fee her on life ures Drihtenes fet mid hire tearum\nOf sancta Elisabeth.\nOf sancta Aga\u00f0a reliquion of hire to\u00f0on sume IIII & of hire haligrefte.\nOf sancta Iuliana \u00feam halgan m\u00e6dene, \u00fee on \u00feam gewinne hire martyrdomes swa swi\u00f0e w\u00e6s \u00feurh \u00f0a\nOf sancta Cecilia \u00feam \u00e6\u00f0elan m\u00e6dene.\nOf sancta Agnete.\nOf sancta Praxede \u00feam m\u00e6dene.\nOf sancta Eugenia.\nSancta Felicula ribb \u00fe\u00e6s halgan m\u00e6denes.\nOf sancta Margareta.\nOf sancta Lucia.\nOf sancta Mamilla.\nOf sancta Balthilde \u00fe\u00e6re halgan cwene.\nOf sancta Leonilla.\nOf sancta Gerethrude \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelan m\u00e6dene.\nOf sancta Genouefa reliquion.\nOf sancta Morenna.\nOf sancta Alfgiua \u00fe\u00e6re halgan Cristes \u00f0inene, seo wolde d\u00e6ghwamlice hire andettnisse don, \u00e6r heo\nOf sancta Satiuola \u00feam bylewitan m\u00e6dene, seo w\u00e6s unsce\u00f0\u00f0iglice acweald fram hire f\u00e6der\nAnd God \u00e6lmihtig si\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6t hire birgene geswutelode m\u00e6nigfealde wundra.\nOf sancta Sigeburga.\nOf sancta W\u00e6rburga.\nOf sancta Brigida hleorbane \u00fe\u00e6s deorwir\u00f0an m\u00e6denes, \u00fee manege wundra her on life \u00feurh God",
